# U2 Implementer — verify-beat port DONE

## Changed paths

- bin/spine-spawn — verify-mark / verify-status / make subcommands; Plan→Implementation gate for `--profile coder`; forced `git worktree add` isolation; `SPINE_VERIFY_GATE=off` break-glass audit to ~/.tower/ledger.jsonl; docstring fix for cursor kind
- docs/verify-beat.md — spine wall summary
- .gitignore — `.verify/`

## Reproduce gate refuse (exit 2, before pane create)

```bash
BRIEF=/path/to/unmarked-brief.md
python3 ~/herdr-spine/bin/spine-spawn worker \
  --label agnt-demo --kind pi --profile coder --brief "$BRIEF"
python3 ~/herdr-spine/bin/spine-spawn worker \
  --label agnt-demo --kind claude --profile coder --brief "$BRIEF"
```

## Local verification (2026-08-12, worktree wt-agnt-coder-w2k-p6)

```bash
# unmarked coder refuse → exit 2, stderr names verify-mark/make + isolation law
python3 bin/spine-spawn worker --kind pi --profile coder --brief /tmp/unmarked.md --label smoke

# coder without --brief → exit 2
python3 bin/spine-spawn worker --kind pi --profile coder --label nolabel --prompt test

# verify-mark → exit 0; marker at ~/herdr-spine/.verify/<key>/.authored
python3 bin/spine-spawn verify-mark /tmp/brief.md
python3 bin/spine-spawn verify-status /tmp/brief.md   # exit 0 when marked, 1 when missing

# break-glass → WARN stderr + ledger verify-gate-bypass row
SPINE_VERIFY_GATE=off python3 bin/spine-spawn worker --kind pi --profile coder --brief /tmp/brief.md --label bg
grep verify-gate-bypass ~/.tower/ledger.jsonl | tail -1
```

Verified exit codes (2026-08-12T18:35:10Z): pi_refuse=2, no_brief=2, break-glass ledger append confirmed.

Marked coder spawn logs worktree under `~/.spine/worktrees/<repo>/<label>/` before split.

## Deviations

None. Marker store anchors to git common-dir parent (`~/herdr-spine/.verify/`) so worktree checkouts share one gate ledger — per locked design item 3.

